            "sid": "NEH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilyamasile kutaŵidwa lipupa lya msinda lila, naŵisile matanga, acilonda ŵa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE ŵandu ŵakwimba nyimbo, nipo Alefi nombe nawo ŵasagulidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namsagwile mlongo mjangu Hanani pamo ni Hananiya kuti aŵe ŵakulolela lipupa lya asilikali. Hananiya ŵaliji mundu jwakulupicika ni jwakumjogopa Mlungu kwapunda ŵandu ŵajinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasalile jemanjajo kuti yipata ya ku Yelusalemu yiwugulidweje lyuŵa lili likopwece, nipo ayiwugaleje yipatayo acilonda mkanaŵeluce ligulo. Nasalile soni kuti asagule acilonda sikati ja ŵandu ŵakutama mu Yelusalemu, kuti jwalijose atameje pa malo gakwe, soni ŵane atameje pa malo gakulolegana ni nyumba syawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mena ga ŵandu ŵaŵawusile ku ukapolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msinda wa Yelusalemu waliji wekulungwa, nambo ŵandu ŵakutama mu msindamo ŵaliji ŵapanandi, soni mwaliji mwangali nyumba syejinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mlungu ŵambele une nganisyo syakuti nasonganye acimlongola, acakulungwakulungwa ni ŵandu kuti alembedwe mena pakukuya maŵasa gawo. Nipo najisimene buku ja mena ga ŵandu ŵiŵawusile pandanda pene kutyocela ku ukapolo. Ayi ni yele yiŵalembile m'bukumo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga ni mena ga ŵandu ŵa ku upande wa ku Yuda ŵiŵawusile kutyocela ku ukapolo, kuŵapite pakujigalidwa ni Nebukadinesa, mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya. Ŵanduwo ŵawujilile ku Yelusalemu ni ku Yuda, jwalijose ku msinda wa kumangwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjaji ŵawusile pamo ni acimlongola ŵakuyicisyaŵa: Selubabele, Yeswa, Nehemiya, Asaliya, Lamiya, Nahamani, Modekayi, Bilisani, Misipali, Bigifayi, Nehumu, ni Baana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
